TEXT 1232 -752 Left 2 !.tran 0 40 0 1m
TEXT 1232 -544 Left 2 ;Since for each sensor a voltage too high or too low \nindicates unsafe operation a window comparator can be \nused to output logic HIGH when the input signal Vin is \nwithin a certain range, and logic LOW when outside of \nsaid range.
TEXT 1232 -696 Left 2 ;The purpose of the window comparators is to output a logic\nHIGH when a sensor detects safe operation.
TEXT -152 -568 Left 6 ;Over Voltage
TEXT -184 744 Left 6 ;Over Current
