TEXT 496 -1000 Left 7 ;Digital Logic
TEXT 704 320 Center 2 ;74HC08D, 63 \nAND Gate Placeholder
TEXT 656 1560 Center 2 ;74HC08D, 63 \nAND Gate Placeholder
